---
description: Compare recollections of events while preserving speaker-specific dates and contextual cues.
args: { dossier: OralHistoryDossier; change: ArchiveChange; accounts: OralHistoryAccount[]; references: OralHistoryReference[] }
returns: RecollectionComparison[]
---
Group accounts about a possible shared event only when their context supports that relation. Preserve each speaker's remembered date and certainty language. When dates differ, label the chronology disputed and show both source accounts; do not select one date as true without an independent record. Preserve unresolved identity references separately from event identity.
